        // Given constraints, the only feasible way is to fuzz newOwner while having the caller be the current owner. The only address that can be the owner of c right now is address(0) because owner is uninitialized. The onlyOwner modifier with owner==address(0) means no one can call transferOwnership. To create an admissible input where actor is current owner, we can first set owner to actor by using delegatecall from the deployer? Not allowed.
